   Grey 200×200 rectangle + red 80×80 ellipse on top. Static, no animation.
   → If red ellipse is INVISIBLE: confirms draw-order reversal hypothesis
   → If red ellipse is VISIBLE: draw order is standard; bug is elsewhere

2. fromjson_autumn_sky_last.riv (from fromjson/autumn_sky_last.json):
   Identical to autumn_leaves but sky rectangle listed LAST in children.
   Stream order: leaf1-5 (art-rel 1,5,9,13,17) then sky (art-rel 21).
   → If leaves are now VISIBLE: draw order is reversed (first=top), sky
     renders first/bottom, leaves visible. Fix confirmed.
   → If EVERYTHING is now sky-colored: sky renders last/top, standard order,
     and some other bug is responsible.

